{"id": "47292", "title": "俄罗斯美女", "author": "[俄]维克多·叶罗菲耶夫", "category": "文学名著", "count": 47, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/47/47292/47292s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/47/47292.htm", "intro": "一个美丽的姑娘从外省来到都市,在社会环境和时代氛围的作用下沉沦了,她曾把家庭幸福的希望寄托在一个又一个男人的身上,却每每落空,最终,怀有身孕而且一无所有的她,只好答应嫁给一个死人。《俄罗斯美女》面世之后,立即走红,并迅速被翻译成了二十余种外语。如今,十多年过去了,《俄罗斯美女》仍被摆在俄罗斯各大书店的醒目位置上,学者们在谈到当代俄罗斯文学时也都不能不提到这部作品。", "base": "files/article/html/47/47292", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "6404939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "6404940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "6404941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "6404942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "6404943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "6404944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "6404945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "6404946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "6404947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "6404948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "6404949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "6404950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "6404952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "6404953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "6404954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "6404955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "6404956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "6404957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "6404958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "6404959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "6404960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "6404961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "6404962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章